{"quest":{"line_id":"14010347","line_type":"3","order":27,"title":{"en":"One More Minecart Ride","jp":"もう一度トロッコに","kr":"광차 한 번 더 타기","cn":"再坐一次矿车"},"title_status":"editorial","description":{"en":"Prerequisite: Complete “Ask Zanie” in “An Unexpected Sight”. Complete “Check the Minecart” in “An Unexpected Sight”.\nUse the cart at its currently available end. Use the same end of the minecart route three times, returning between rides. Then approach the nearby passenger.\nLocation: Brimstone Mine 6.","jp":"前提条件：「思いがけない景色」の「ゾーヤに尋ねる」を完了する。 「思いがけない景色」の「トロッコを調べる」を完了する。\n現在利用できる側のトロッコを使う。 同じ乗り場からトロッコに3回乗る。乗るたびに元の乗り場へ戻り、その後、近くの乗客に近づく。\n場所：6-オルディン鉱区。","kr":"선행 조건: 「예상치 못한 풍경」의 「조아에게 물어보기」 완료. 「예상치 못한 풍경」의 「수레 조사하기」 완료.\n현재 이용할 수 있는 쪽의 광차 사용하기. 매번 출발 지점으로 돌아와 같은 쪽에서 광차를 세 번 탄 뒤 근처 승객에게 다가가기.\n장소: 6-깊은바위 광산 지대.","cn":"前置条件：完成《未曾预料的风景》中的“询问祖娅是否有所发现”。 完成《未曾预料的风景》中的“检查矿车”。\n使用当前可用一侧的矿车。 从同一端乘坐矿车三次，每次乘坐后返回原处，再靠近附近的乘客。\n地点：6-深岩矿区。"},"description_status":"source_based_trigger_summary","configured_rewards":[],"encounter_rewards":[],"assets":[{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14347010"}],"tasks":[],"source_contract":{"line_id":"14010347","section":"season_4","line":{"kind":"ExplLine","shard":"1401","record_order":"504","table_key":"14010347","record_key":"14010347","choice_index":"","LineID":"14010347","LineName":"EP4彩蛋-ZONE4-矿车","ZoneGroupID":"10018","LineType":"3","LastTaskID":"1","ShowCondition":"true","RecvConditionText":"","LineDes":"","ShowAction":"true","Rewards":"[]","ResetObjects":"[]","ResetDynGroups":"[]","ResetItems":"[]","ExtraParam":"","BlockShow":"false","EffectCondition":"true","DGender":"false","Gender":"false"},"tasks":[{"kind":"ExplTask","shard":"1401","record_order":"1119","table_key":"14010347","record_key":"14010347:1","choice_index":"","LineID":"14010347","TaskID":"1","NextTaskIDs":"[]","ClientRecvEvents":"[ExplTaskFinish:14010105:2]","RecvCondition":"ed.ConditionX.IsExplTaskFinished(14010105,2)","ClientRecvActionByMove":"true","RecvAction":"ed.ActionX.AddStates(900713,